;; the standard axioms are Init's own, in a load with no export too. This file is no part of the
;; case's load: kernel/test/loader_test.shard loads it alone with no export named, where no name
;; of Init is known to be taken. The module `Quot` declares an axiom `sound` — by its name a
;; standard axiom, by its origin the load's own declaration — and the policy places it outside
;; (`POLICY Quot.sound outside the policy: Quot.sound`)
(axiom sound () Prop)
